! GFZA (Boxes 43, 60): the end of the data, the operators, no more
! operators, and no g.p. (Box 46: "the bit at the end ... set to zero").
! After a g.p. (Boxes 37-38): 1, n in 6 bits, then its value, an expression
! of its own in the radix r (zero: 10); a field with no data before its
! g.p. is null (as strap2: "(.3)5"), a value with none is not.
GFZA    L(BU,1), GFGP
        KI(BU,1), 1
        BZAE, GFZA0
