! GFPUSH: GFNEW onto the operator stack.  GFTOP: the top entry, GFSN's
! less one, to GFOP (the caller lowers GFSN to take it off).  GFPUT: GFOP's
! operator into GFOPS, 1, code, datum number (p.198 3A-3C).
GFPUSH  L(BU,8), GFSN
